**Suite is green: 625 total, 625 passing.**

The bug was in `orderTotal` in [src/pricing.js:39](src/pricing.js:39). It taxed the pre-discount amount instead of the discounted one.

Fixed by taxing the discounted total instead:
```js
function orderTotal(cents, discountPct, taxRate) {
  const discounted = applyDiscount(cents, discountPct);
  return applyTax(discounted, taxRate);
}
```

No other suites had failures. Nothing further needed.
